DexiNed family notice
=====================

Code provenance
---------------
The neural-network architecture in ``nn.py`` is ported from:

    https://github.com/xavysp/DexiNed
    commit 08ed67ad0579f3969536a9719cdc1b829fb74fc1
    License: MIT
    Copyright (c) 2019 Xavier Soria Poma

Only the DexiNed runtime architecture is ported. The LibreYOLO task wrapper,
preprocessing graph, result contract, dataset loader, validator, metrics, and
export integration are original LibreYOLO code under the repository MIT
license.

Weights and data
----------------
No DexiNed checkpoint is bundled or mirrored. The upstream released checkpoint
was trained on BIPED, whose published terms restrict the dataset to
non-commercial use. ``weights/convert_dexined_weights.py`` operates only on a
local checkpoint supplied by the user and does not alter its applicable
terms.

